[1mWhat I verified myself[22m (I did the work directly rather than delegating, so there were no sub-agent claims to check):[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- Built the C reference the way [38;5;10mc_src/CMakeLists.txt[0m specifies (cmake → [38;5;10mcc[0m with no optimization flags) and diffed stdout, stderr, and exit code against the Rust binary.[0m[0m
